    "title": "Classes at the Mobile Botanical Gardens - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Studio10 Staff ,\n1 days ago MOBILE, Ala. (WALA) - The Mobile Botanical Garden is located right here in Mobile in Langan Park. A primary focus of the Gardens’ mission is to instill passion for nature, and one of the ways we do this is by offering a variety of classes related to plants, gardening, nature, and the environment. New classes are being added constantly, and some of our most popular classes are related to beekeeping, and different uses and recipes for honey. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
